# Elder Memories (otherAreas 24) and The Old Lady (otherAreas 10): the mutual exclusion and the reply kinds on Isacio, the
# only NPC both quests answer in Selbina (no script, no default, no other quest), and on Vera. The Old Lady accepted (a
# GM): Elder Memories' available section is off: Isacio's 99 (The Old Lady's replaceDefault) instead of 111; The Old
# Lady completed: 99 again. Both accepted (The Old Lady available, then accepted), Prog 0: Isacio's 114 (Event) beats 99
# (replaceDefault) every time (a replaceDefault 114 would tie: 114 then 99); Prog 3: Elder Memories' nil: 99 alone. Elder
# Memories completed, The Old Lady accepted: its 118 (replaceDefault) and 99 tie: 118, then 99 (Elder_Memories sorts
# first; an Event or Progress 118 would play every time). Mhaura: Vera: The Old Lady's 132 (Event, Prog 0) beats Elder
# Memories' 130 (replaceDefault) every time. Event against Progress cannot be told apart on these two NPCs (no third
# reply): 111 / 117 (Progress) and 119 / 114 (Event) are XI.Verify.Quests `oa g2 kinds`.
lists Selbina/Isacio/onTrigger Mhaura/Vera/onTrigger Selbina/onEventFinish/111
char zone=Selbina pos=-56.6,-0.9,-46.4 job=WAR lvl=30
quest OtherAreas.TheOldLady accepted
login
trigger Isacio                          # The Old Lady accepted: Elder Memories off: 99 (replaceDefault)
finish
quest OtherAreas.TheOldLady completed   # a GM
trigger Isacio                          # The Old Lady completed: Elder Memories off: 99
finish
quest OtherAreas.TheOldLady available   # a GM
quest OtherAreas.TheOldLady accepted    # a GM
quest OtherAreas.ElderMemories accepted # a GM: both accepted
trigger Isacio                          # Prog 0: 114 (538) (Event beats 99)
finish
trigger Isacio                          # 114 again
finish
charvar Quest[4][24]Prog 3              # a GM
trigger Isacio                          # Elder Memories' nil: 99
finish
quest OtherAreas.ElderMemories completed # a GM
trigger Isacio                          # 118 (a tie of replaceDefault replies: Elder Memories' first)
finish
trigger Isacio                          # 99
finish
trigger Isacio                          # 118
finish
warp -51.5,-3.9,17.2 Mhaura
trigger Vera                            # The Old Lady at Prog 0: 132 (542) beats 130
finish
trigger Vera                            # 132 again
finish
